<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
  <div>
    <h3 class="mb-0">Security Event Simulator</h3>
    <div class="text-secondary small">Generate synthetic events for demonstration. Nothing here touches a real system.</div>
  </div>
  <button id="clearBtn" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">
    <i class="bi bi-trash me-1"></i>Clear All Log Data
  </button>
</div>

<div id="statusBox" class="alert alert-secondary d-none"></div>

<div class="row g-3">
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-warning w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="brute-force">
      <i class="bi bi-key-fill d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Brute Force
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-warning w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="port-scan">
      <i class="bi bi-hdd-network d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Port Scan
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="suspicious-powershell">
      <i class="bi bi-terminal-fill d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Suspicious PowerShell
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="privilege-escalation">
      <i class="bi bi-person-fill-up d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Privilege Escalation
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="malware">
      <i class="bi bi-bug-fill d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Malware Detection
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-warning w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="suspicious-login">
      <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Suspicious Login
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4 col-lg-3">
    <button class="btn btn-outline-warning w-100 py-3 sim-btn" data-type="web-attack">
      <i class="bi bi-globe d-block fs-3 mb-2"></i>Web Attack
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-secondary mt-4">
  <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>
  Each click generates fake events, saves them, and runs them through the detection engine.
  Open the <a href="/">Dashboard</a>, <a href="/alerts">Alerts</a>, or <a href="/logs">Logs</a> page in another tab
  before clicking - you'll see it update live via Socket.IO, no refresh needed.
</div>
